          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="War-driven spikes in commodity and geopolitical risk premia trigger re-pricing and cross-border capital flows that amplify price swings specifically in equities, FX and bonds tied to the US–China tech sector." />
